ks with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)/Colors":{"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)\/Colors","kind":"article","title":"Colors","role":"article","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(lime)\/colors","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)/Fonts":{"title":"Fonts","abstract":[],"role":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(lime)\/fonts","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)\/Fonts","kind":"article"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)":{"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(lime)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(lime)","title":"Swift Package Lime Tutorial","type":"topic","kind":"overview","role":"overview","abstract":[{"text":"Learn how to create a custom OUDS theme by overriding tokens from the Orange theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In this tutorial, you will build the Lime fake theme with its own properties","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You’ll discover how to customize colors, spacings, borders, elevations, colored surfaces, fonts and tuning.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-lime-4-borders":{"abstract":[{"text":"Borders can be defined with line width, style, and corner radius. In this chapter, we will override some border semantic tokens to customize components.","type":"text"}],"title":"Borders","estimatedTime":"10min","role":"project","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-lime-4-borders","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-lime-4-borders","kind":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-lime-1-package-a